{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The central resolver check would close runtime shadowing once Rule R is fully cut over. The proposed interim Change A is different: while `yin/def` remains a primitive, a composition can still supply that registry entry, and changing lookup precedence is itself a versioned execution change. I’m resolving that split before the final gate call."}}
